:: Road [room: road]
The river road runs east to a tollhouse, where a gate bars the bridge. {if pebble.location?.id === "road"}A [[river pebble]]{menu pebble} lies in the dust.{/if}
You carry a [[satchel]]{menu satchel}, which holds {listContents(satchel)}.
{exits}

:: Tollhouse [room: tollhouse]
A cramped room smelling of pipe smoke. The [[toll keeper]]{menu keeper} sits by a [[strongbox]]{menu strongbox}{if strongbox.isOpen}, open, holding {listContents(strongbox)}{else}, shut tight{/if}. North, the [[toll gate]]{menu gate} bars the bridge.
{notices}
{exits}

:: Bridge [room: bridge]
Planks creak under you. The river runs fast and brown below.
{exits}

:: Far Bank [room: farBank]
You step off the bridge onto the far bank. The road goes on, and so do you.
